ADAPTIVE / HIG / a11y / units
  - macOS/iPad (regular): panel header + bulk action side-by-side. iPhone
    (compact, horizontalSizeClass): stacked. Driven by @Observable model (ADR-004),
    no networking in the view.
  - Materials via TSGlassPanel; tokens-only color/typography (P2). Destructive
    confirms via .confirmationDialog (HIG). Timestamps formatted at the display
    boundary only (Date.formatted) — never stored non-SI.
  - VoiceOver labels/traits on panel + rows + actions, Dynamic Type, light/dark +
    increased-contrast via tokens, ≥44pt targets (TSButton).
  - Every visible string via LocalizedStringKey/String(localized:) from
    Localizable.xcstrings with web-aligned key names; zero hardcoded literals.

